)\\times {r}^{″}(t) & =⟨0,\\,3,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩\\times ⟨0,\\,0,\\,6t⟩ \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3{t}^{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6t\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 3{t}^{2} \\\\ 0 & 6t\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3{t}^{2} \\\\ 0 & 6t\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =18t\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute the magnitude of the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t)‖ & =|18t|=18t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that since $t>0$, we have $|t|=t.$\nTherefore, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{r}^{′}(t)\\times {r}^{″}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t){‖}^{3}}=\\frac{18t}{{(3\\sqrt{1+{t}^{4}})}^{3}}=\\frac{2t}{3(1+{t}^{4})^{3/2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367916 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367917 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367918 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367919 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367920 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186367916 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367915 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8cbcea62-bc50-5399-998e-516065a90ade" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367916 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367916 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367916 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d37b0ad3-d75a-5e9c-b32f-03d04a5aa5da" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367917 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367917 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367917 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "07857a98-a240-5250-8ec4-acfbd5c7ae04" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218636791